  "text": "NINA: Hello, I’m calling about volunteering at the Harbour Museum.\n\nTOM: Welcome. I’m Tom, the volunteer coordinator. We’re always looking for new helpers.\n\nNINA: Great. What does the work involve (Q1)?\n\nTOM: Mostly guiding school groups around the galleries on weekday mornings. It’s got a lot of stairs, so please wear comfortable shoes and bring a bottle of water.\n\nNINA: Is there a charge for the training day?\n\nTOM: The training is free (Q2), but the guidebook costs £8.50, or £12 with the audio guide.\n\nNINA: And when does the next training day start (Q3)?\n\nTOM: It starts on the 24th at half past nine, and everyone meets at the main entrance. The training is only a half-day session, so you can still work the same afternoon.\n\n----------------------------\n\nNINA: Do I need any special skills?\n\nTOM: Not really. You listen, you smile, and you answer questions. Last year we guided over 200 school groups, and most of them came back again.\n\nNINA: That sounds good. I’ll send my details today.\n\nTOM: Perfect. I’ll email the form this afternoon."
 },
